<div class="min-h-screen bg-[var(--lc-bg-page)] pb-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px] px-4 py-6 sm:px-6"><div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><a href="/contacts/cnt_wave8"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] h-tap w-tap min-h-tap min-w-tap" aria-label="Back to contact"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-left h-4 w-4"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"></path><path d="M19 12H5"></path></svg></button></a><div><h1 class="font-semibold text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-heading-1);">Relationships</h1><p class="text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-lg)] text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Formalize how you represent this contact so leads route correctly and exclusive claims are protected.</p></div></div><header class="sticky top-0 z-10 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-sunken)] px-[var(--lc-space-md)] py-[var(--lc-space-sm)]"><span class="relative flex shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full h-12 w-12"><span class="flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)]">OH</span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="truncate font-semibold" style="font: var(--lc-type-heading-2);">Omar Hassan</p><p class="truncate text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-sm)] text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" dir="ltr">omar@example.com</p></div><a class="text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-sm)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary)] hover:underline" href="/contacts/cnt_wave8">View contact →</a></header><section aria-labelledby="snap-labelledby" class="mt-[var(--lc-space-2xl)]"><div class="mb-[var(--lc-space-md)] flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><h2 id="snap-0" class="font-semibold text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-heading-2);">My relationships <div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] align-middle">(1)</div></h2><button class="items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-primary-hover)] min-h-tap px-4 py-2 ms-auto hidden sm:inline-flex"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus me-1 h-4 w-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>Add relationship</button></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-md)]"><article aria-labelledby="snap-labelledby" class="rounded-[var(--lc-radius-lg)] border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-raised)] p-[var(--lc-space-lg)] shadow-[var(--lc-elevation-sm)]" style="border-left-width: 4px; border-left-color: var(--lc-status-underOffer-dot);"><div class="flex flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-md)]"><div id="snap-1"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none gap-1 border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-status-published-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-published-fg)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-handshake h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4"></path><path d="m21 3 1 11h-2"></path><path d="M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="M3 4h8"></path></svg>Representation</div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-sunken)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]">Buyer</div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)] ms-auto gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Exclusive</div></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-sm)]"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-status-underOffer-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-underOffer-fg)]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-1" style="color: var(--lc-status-underOffer-dot);">◐</span><span class="sr-only">Status: </span>Pending</div><span class="text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Requested 9/1/2026 · Would run <span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">9/1/2026</span> → <span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">9/1/2026</span></span></div><div class="rounded-[var(--lc-radius-md)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-sunken)] p-[var(--lc-space-md)] text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-sm)]"><p class="mb-2 font-semibold text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]">Scope</p><dl class="grid gap-1 text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]"><div class="flex gap-2"><dt class="w-20 shrink-0">Areas</dt><dd class="text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]">dubai-marina</dd></div><div class="flex gap-2"><dt class="w-20 shrink-0">Type</dt><dd class="text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]">apartment</dd></div><div class="flex gap-2"><dt class="w-20 shrink-0">Price</dt><dd class="text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]" dir="ltr"><span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">AED 1,200,000 – 2,400,000</span></dd></div><div class="flex gap-2"><dt class="w-20 shrink-0">Subjects</dt><dd class="text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]">No specific property — open search</dd></div></dl></div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none w-fit gap-1 border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-status-unpublished-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-unpublished-fg)]" aria-live="polite"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg>No consent on file — required</div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-t border-[var(--lc-border)] pt-[var(--lc-space-md)]"><p class="flex-1 text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-sm)] text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Waiting on Omar Hassan to confirm via link.</p><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-3">Resend confirmation</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-3">Edit</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-3 text-[var(--lc-status-unpublished-fg)]">Cancel request</button></div></div></article></div></section><section aria-labelledby="snap-labelledby" class="mt-[var(--lc-space-2xl)]"><h2 id="snap-2" class="mb-2 font-semibold text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-heading-2);">Other agencies representing this contact</h2><p class="mb-[var(--lc-space-md)] text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-sm)] text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">You can see that other relationships exist so you don't create conflicting exclusive claims. Names and evidence are redacted per this contact's privacy settings.</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-md)]"><article title="This information comes from another agency's records. You cannot edit it. It appears so you don't accidentally create a conflicting exclusive claim." class="cursor-default rounded-[var(--lc-radius-lg)] border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-sunken)] p-[var(--lc-space-lg)] opacity-85" style="border-left-width: 4px; border-left-color: var(--lc-status-published-dot);"><div class="pointer-events-none flex flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-sm)]"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none gap-1 border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-status-published-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-published-fg)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-handshake h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m11 17 2 2a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="m14 14 2.5 2.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3l-3.88-3.88a3 3 0 0 0-4.24 0l-.88.88a1 1 0 1 1-3-3l2.81-2.81a5.79 5.79 0 0 1 7.06-.87l.47.28a2 2 0 0 0 1.42.25L21 4"></path><path d="m21 3 1 11h-2"></path><path d="M3 3 2 14l6.5 6.5a1 1 0 1 0 3-3"></path><path d="M3 4h8"></path></svg>Representation</div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-sunken)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]">Buyer</div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)] ms-auto gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>Exclusive</div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-sm)]"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-status-published-bg)] text-[var(--lc-status-published-fg)]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-1" style="color: var(--lc-status-published-dot);">●</span><span class="sr-only">Status: </span>Active</div><span class="text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Since <span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">2026-06</span> · Ends <span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">2027-06</span></span></div><p class="text-[length:var(--lc-type-body-sm)] text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Scope: Dubai · apartment · Price range redacted</p><p class="text-[length:var(--lc-type-caption)] text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Agent + agency: hidden per contact privacy</p></div></article></div></section></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-primary-hover)] min-h-tap fixed bottom-6 end-6 z-20 h-14 w-14 rounded-full p-0 sm:hidden shadow-[var(--lc-elevation-lg)]" type="button" aria-label="Add relationship"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-6 w-6"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></div><div role="region" aria-label="Notifications (F8)" tabindex="-1" style="pointer-events: none;"><ol tabindex="-1" class="fixed top-0 z-toast flex max-w-[420px] flex-col gap-2 p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]"></ol></div>"
`;

exports[`Wave 8 visual matrix — Chromatic stand-ins > 12 ProListingsTable-dark-rtl-desktop 1`] = `
"<!-- mode=dark dir=rtl lang=ar vw=1024 -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-md)]" data-testid="pro-listings-table" data-screen="AGT-LST-002" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Listings table"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-[var(--lc-space-sm)]"><h1 class="text-[var(--lc-text-heading)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-heading-2); letter-spacing: var(--lc-tracking-heading-2);">Listings</h1><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)] rounded-pill">All</div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] rounded-pill">My active drafts</div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] rounded-pill">Below market price</div><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none border-transparent bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] rounded-pill">Expiring soon</div></div><div class="ms-auto flex items-center gap-2"><div role="group" aria-label="View mode" class="flex rounded-[var(--lc-radius-md)] border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-raised)] p-0.5"><button type="button" class="min-h-tap rounded-[var(--lc-radius-sm)] bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] px-3 text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);" aria-pressed="true">Table</button><button type="button" class="min-h-tap rounded-[var(--lc-radius-sm)] px-3 text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);" aria-pressed="false">Cards</button></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-primary-hover)] min-h-tap px-4 py-2 gap-1.5" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>New listing</button></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-b border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-raised)] px-[var(--lc-space-sm)] py-[var(--lc-space-sm)]"><span class="text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body-sm);"><span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">3</span> of <span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">3</span> listings</span><button type="button" class="ms-auto inline-flex min-h-tap items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-2 text-[var(--lc-text-muted)] hover:text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]" aria-label="Customize columns"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-columns2 h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M12 3v18"></path></svg></button></div><div class="overflow-auto rounded-[var(--lc-radius-lg)] border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-raised)] shadow-[var(--lc-elevation-sm)]"><table class="min-w-full border-collapse"><thead class="bg-[var(--lc-surface-sunken)]"><tr class="border-b border-[var(--lc-border)]"><th scope="col" class="sticky start